        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "APF9";
        skos:definition        "The APF9 controller board manufactured by Teledyne Webb controls the air and buoyancy pumps and interfaces with the GPS receiver, the Iridium modem, the CTD, and any additionally installed science sensors. It also includes the float's microcomputer, an internal clock, operational firmware and program and data memory, and it inputs and processes signals from a leak detector and internal temperature, pressure and humidity sensors. APF9 controller boards were used in APEX floats manufactured between around 2008-2017."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:R28::CB0015";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "APF9"@en .

